Architecture: amd64
Depends: bash, awk, sed, acl, sysstat, setpriv | util-linux (>= 2.33), zstd, lsb-release, idn2, jq, bubblewrap, at
Description: TulioCP web hosting control panel
 TulioCP is an open source hosting control panel with a clean, focused
 interface for managing web domains, mail accounts, DNS zones and databases
 from a single dashboard.
 .
 TulioCP is an independently maintained fork of Hestia Control Panel, which is
 itself a fork of Vesta Control Panel. It is not affiliated with, nor endorsed
 by, either project.
